ng the most work here — a finance copilot that gets paid by the user instead of by the products it recommends is the only version of this that can be trusted. Read-only is the right starting boundary, but the interesting", "url": "https://x.com/maga_musk/status/2118506539497717969"}, {"author_id": "2084805138389303296", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:50:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118506348052939121"], "id": "2118506348052939121", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1943306828697550848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118403114890137895", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@claudeai keen to see how the data is handled", "url": "https://x.com/sam_builds_ai/status/2118506348052939121"}, {"author_id": "1707431268282208256", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:48:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118505892027199807"], "id": "2118505892027199807", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1943306828697550848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118403114890137895", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@claudeai Big AI companies are coming to take over smaller niches", "url": "https://x.com/liamisbuilding/status/2118505892027199807"}, {"author_id": "1359681986495799296", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:44:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504665726042571"], "id": "2118504665726042571", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1943306828697550848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118403114890137895", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@claudeai Yes, this is what I've been hoping for, because this is the exact use case I've been wanting to use with Duet.", "url": "https://x.com/thesunofdog/status/2118504665726042571"